    "name": "Unnatural Worlds",
    "steam_appid": 2369780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy Game, Not Action Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/9db5a467d0d842773b1c26b4613b02ff.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big /></span>The game supports up to few thousands of units on the battlefield. Therefore, you must focus on thoughtful planning and strategic placement of your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual units micromanagement is avoided wherever possible. Units have no user-activated skills. Just attack-move or leave them alone, and the units will do the best, on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also ensure protection of your supply lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Any-Shape 3D Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.poster.avif?t=1750504623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.webm?t=1750504623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play on the surface of any 3D shape, such as a planet, potato, horseshoe, or gear. Perhaps several islands floating in void connected with small bridges. Perhaps a stuck clockwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most places can be ambushed from many directions. Units may shoot across void, if visible and in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determining the strategic value of various positions on the map is a crucial skill to master the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources In The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/76469a4d14637c27d977f817fc13ec4b.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is over a dozen types of resources: raw ores, intermediate goods, and military parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All resources are on pallets or in boxes, existing directly in the world, and requiring transportation. Trucks are controlled automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UW has no technology tree or research. Progression is achieved through acquiring or refining new resources.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy Game, Not Action Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/9db5a467d0d842773b1c26b4613b02ff.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big /></span>The game supports up to few thousands of units on the battlefield. Therefore, you must focus on thoughtful planning and strategic placement of your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual units micromanagement is avoided wherever possible. Units have no user-activated skills. Just attack-move or leave them alone, and the units will do the best, on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also ensure protection of your supply lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Any-Shape 3D Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.poster.avif?t=1750504623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.webm?t=1750504623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play on the surface of any 3D shape, such as a planet, potato, horseshoe, or gear. Perhaps several islands floating in void connected with small bridges. Perhaps a stuck clockwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most places can be ambushed from many directions. Units may shoot across void, if visible and in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determining the strategic value of various positions on the map is a crucial skill to master the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources In The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/76469a4d14637c27d977f817fc13ec4b.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is over a dozen types of resources: raw ores, intermediate goods, and military parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All resources are on pallets or in boxes, existing directly in the world, and requiring transportation. Trucks are controlled automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UW has no technology tree or research. Progression is achieved through acquiring or refining new resources.</p>",
    "short_description": "Revolutionary grand-scale RTS game played on maps of any 3D shape. It emphasizes base building and logistics, careful planning, and minimizes micro-management of units.",
